      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240426/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir corn, green beans, tomato sauce, and tomato paste with the beef.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B9OyQ5L_qrd1zMCZiIpw9SR5D0Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-240426-homemade-vegetable-beef-soup-DDMFS-step-3-bb1313d52153407f8631bd49f062e32f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/240426/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour tomato-vegetable juice into the pot; season with garlic powder, onion powder, salt, and pepper. Bring the mixture to a boil, reduce heat to low, and cook for 5 hours.",
